==== stdout ====
Usage: raphael version [--json]
       raphael --version [--json]

Print the installed Raphael release.

Works offline: reads no configuration and contacts no server.

To compare with a server, run raphael status, which reports both sides.

Options:
      --json
      Also print the protocol version, as one JSON document.
  -h, --help
      Show help.

Examples:
  raphael version
  raphael version --json
  raphael --version

Prints:
  The bare release number. JSON has version and protocolVersion.

Next: raphael status
